@startuml
title COS 校園點餐系統 - Sequence Diagram（Order Processing）
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor "學生\nStudent" as Student
participant "Frontend\ncheckout.html" as FE
participant "Flask Route\nbackend.app" as Route
participant "Models\nbackend.models" as Models
database "SQLite\ncampus_ordering.db" as DB

Student -> FE : 前往結帳
FE -> Route : GET /checkout
Route -> Models : get_cart_groups(cart_token)
Models -> DB : SELECT carts JOIN cart_items\nJOIN products JOIN merchants
DB --> Models : rows
Models --> Route : merchant_groups, total
Route -> Models : get_recent_orders(cart_token)
Models -> DB : SELECT orders + order_items
DB --> Models : orders
Models --> Route : orders
Route -> Route : 若無 checkout_key 則產生 UUID
Route --> FE : 200 checkout.html\n(idempotency_key, orders)

Student -> FE : 確認送出訂單
FE -> Route : POST /orders/create\n(idempotency_key)
Route -> Route : 比對表單 key 與 session key
alt key 不存在或不相符
  Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash「結帳資訊已過期」
else key 相符
  Route -> Models : create_orders_from_cart(cart_token, key)
  Models -> DB : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
  Models -> DB : SELECT checkout_batches\nWHERE session_token, idempotency_key
  alt 相同批次已存在
    DB --> Models : batch
    Models -> DB : COMMIT
    Models --> Route : (batch_id, replayed=True)
    Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash「未重複送出」
  else 新批次
    Models -> DB : SELECT cart_items JOIN products\nWHERE session_token
    DB --> Models : rows
    alt 購物車為空或商品已下架
      Models -> DB : ROLLBACK
      Models --> Route : raise DomainError
      Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash 錯誤訊息
    else 驗證通過
      Models -> Models : 依 merchant_id 分組\n計算每個商家 total
      Models -> DB : INSERT checkout_batches
      loop 每個商家
        Models -> DB : INSERT orders\n(payment_status='unpaid')
        Models -> DB : INSERT order_items\n(name, unit_price 快照)
      end
      Models -> DB : DELETE cart_items
      Models -> DB : COMMIT
      Models --> Route : (batch_id, replayed=False)
      Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash「訂單已建立」
    end
  end
end

note right of FE
  建立訂單與付款後都會 redirect 到 /checkout；
  隨後的 GET /checkout 會再次呼叫 get_recent_orders() 載入最新訂單。
end note

Student -> FE : 點擊模擬付款
FE -> Route : POST /payment/mock\n(order_id)
Route -> Models : pay_order(cart_token, order_id)
Models -> DB : SELECT payment_status\nWHERE id AND session_token
alt 訂單不存在或不屬於目前學生
  DB --> Models : no row
  Models --> Route : raise DomainError
  Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash「找不到可付款的訂單」
else 已付款
  DB --> Models : payment_status='paid'
  Models --> Route : False
  Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash「此訂單已付款」
else 未付款
  DB --> Models : payment_status='unpaid'
  Models -> DB : UPDATE orders SET payment_status='paid'
  Models --> Route : True
  Route --> FE : redirect /checkout\nFlash「模擬付款成功」
end

note over Student, FE
  使用者操作瀏覽器；付款僅為模擬流程
  不進行真實扣款
end note

note over Route
  路由層只接受 product_id / quantity /
  idempotency_key / order_id 等識別資料
  金額與商家由後端決定
end note

note over Models, DB
  建單在同一個 transaction 內完成
  失敗時全部 rollback，購物車保持不變
end note
@enduml
